OL,3,ABadenoch pledges inheritance tax
OL,4,Achanges as she pitches Tories as
OL,5,A'no-nonsense' party
OL,6,
OL,7,FBadenoch also used her speech to try to
OL,8,Fmake clear how the Tories differed to
OL,9,FLabour and Reform UK.
OL,11,FShe pitched them as the "no-nonsense
OL,12,Fparty" compared to the Reform UK
OL,13,F"circus" and accused Prime Minister
OL,14,FAndy Burnham of wanting to "live in the
OL,15,Fpast".
